AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBPROP_0000008> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002275> "It is essential for governing some of the basic functions of higher organisms, and is one of the phylogenetically oldest portions of the brain.")
